                            <comment id="15924215" author="amashenkov" created="Tue, 14 Mar 2017 13:46:32 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;BinaryUtils.FIELDS_SORTED_ORDER depends on deprecated property IgniteSystemProperties.IGNITE_BINARY_SORT_OBJECT_FIELDS that should be removed in 2.0.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Is there a plan to remove this property and always use TreeMap? Or fields natural sort order is still needed?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
